From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron contributors <electron@github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0800
Subject: feat: filter native WebContents input before Aura and IME dispatch

Allow the embedder to block native pointer or keyboard input independently.
Injected renderer input continues through RenderWidgetHost, bypassing the
OS-facing view entry. TextInputClient mutations share the keyboard gate.

